OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy but dry to start the
OL,6,Fday, becoming wet and windy from late
OL,7,Fmorning onwards, with some heavy and
OL,8,Fblustery outbreaks of rain possible by
OL,9,Fthe evening.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy and wet during the
OL,12,Ffirst half of the night, with strong,
OL,13,Fblustery winds. Clear and dry during
OL,14,Fthe second half of the night, but
OL,15,Fremaining windy.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FAnother windy day, but
OL,18,Fremaining dry in most places, with
OL,19,Fsome sunny spells. The wind will be
OL,20,Fparticularly strong along the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
