OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FRemaining breezy in the coming days,
OL,7,Fwith bands of rain on Monday and
OL,8,FTuesday, followed by sunny spells and
OL,9,Fshowers. A drier and more settled day
OL,10,Foverall by Wednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
